<mxfile host="drawio" agent="draw.io"><diagram id="a1-sdk-rest" name="A1 — SDK / REST deployment"><mxGraphModel dx="1480" dy="742" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="742" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="a1-sdk-rest-1" value="A1 — Deploying a hosted agent with the SDK or REST API from the corporate network" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1-sdk-rest-2" value="Schematic. The client (developer workstation over ExpressRoute/VPN, or a self-hosted pipeline agent) resolves the Foundry host names through the hub DNS and reaches the account private endpoint. Agent creation, code upload, deployment and invocation are data-plane calls; ARM stays public and Entra-protected." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#605e5c;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="42" width="1500" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1-sdk-rest-3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f3f2f1;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48.0" y="84" width="189" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1-sdk-rest-4" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/devops/Azure_DevOps.svg;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=nowrap;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120.5" y="90" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1-sdk-rest-5" value="developer or pipeline agent (corporate network / hub)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x